<title>UK: Rabobank sets $100 mln three-year bond.</title>
<headline>Rabobank sets $100 mln three-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-08-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by joint lead managers ABN AMRO Hoare Govett, Bear Stearns and Rabobank.</p>
<p> BORROWER   RABOBANK NEDERLAND</p>
<p> AMT    $100 MLN	COUPON     7.50	MATURITY    18.AUG.00</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  99.568    PAY DATE    18.AUG.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  0.40	REOFFER    99.568    YIELD	 7.667</p>
<p> SPREAD     +150 BP   LISTING    NONE	PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  =	   DENOMS (K) 500     SALE LIMITS US/UK/BR/NL</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  N/LANDS   TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.20	SELL CONC  0.20	PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p>UNDERLYING GOVT BOND THREE-YEAR US TREASURY</p>
<p> NOTES	LAUNCHED OFF A $250 MLN LIMITED RECOURSE DEBT</p>
<p>		ISSUANCE PROGRAMME</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
